CHD_250312_003.webp A single-story container structure with minimalist architecture, featuring clean lines and simple geometric shapes. The building is 6 meters wide, 2.4 meters deep, and approximately 2.4 meters high. It has an industrial aesthetic with exposed raw concrete walls and a narrow vertical glass facade. A cantilevered roof extends outward, adding to the modern design. The space is functional and well-lit with natural light. Delicate textures enhance the surfaces, and sparse greenery complements the urban setting. The background depicts a cityscape under a cloudy sky with soft, diffused lighting. The composition is symmetrical, with a 1:1 framing, shallow depth of field, realistic reflections, and ambient occlusion.
